{"id":"664277","name":"肉丝炒芹菜","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/664277/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"里脊肉丝","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"芹菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜蓉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"芹菜洗净切段，粗的切成丝状。","img":"images/664277/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"芹菜焯水(时间要短)。","img":"images/664277/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"里脊切成丝，加入鸡蛋清、料酒、少许生抽搅拌均匀。","img":"images/664277/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中放入适量的食用油烧热，小火炒肉丝。","img":"images/664277/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入适量的料酒，下入芹菜翻炒。","img":"images/664277/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入盐、蒜蓉翻炒。","img":"images/664277/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒出锅。","img":"images/664277/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盛入盘中，肉质鲜嫩，芹菜脆爽。","img":"images/664277/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}